Adapt the ETC2 decode shader for ANGLE's EtcToBc.comp

Turns upstream's standalone compute shader into a header that
EtcToBc.comp includes (README.chromium, Local Modifications):
- Drop the shader's own extension, layout, bindings, push constants,
  build_coord(), flip_endian() and main().
- Move the decode logic into ivec4 DecodeRGB(), with punchthrough as
  an inout parameter.
- Add an R11 macro path for EAC R11 (signed and unsigned) decode.
- Rename ALPHA_BITS to alphaBits, and make the int/uint conversions
  explicit.

From 836cc5e2ce ("Vulkan: add etc to bc compute transcoding").

